  "body": "If you've been dreaming of a home with character, warmth and a relaxed coastal feel, this one is well worth exploring!\r\n\r\nJust 600m from beautiful Long Bay Beach and Regional Park, this charming four-bedroom home blends rustic coastal character, modern comforts and versatile family living in a wonderfully peaceful setting filled with beautiful birdsong.\r\n\r\nStep inside and appreciate the warmth of the original timber flooring and inviting interiors. The flexible layout offers options for separate dining, open-plan living or a dedicated work-from-home space.\r\n\r\nThe generous, classic-style lounge is perfect for family gatherings or entertaining friends, while the modernised open plan kitchen flows onto a spacious, north-facing covered deck - ideal for summer BBQs, morning coffees or simply relaxing to the sound of birdsong.\r\n\r\nUpstairs offers four well-sized bedrooms, including the master with ensuite and a modern family bathroom. Downstairs you'll find a large modern powder room, separate laundry and internal-access garaging. \r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n- Four bedrooms, two modern bathrooms plus large powder room\r\n- Generous 210sqm floor area on a 538sqm Freehold section\r\n- Original timber flooring and character-filled interiors\r\n- Flexible living and dining spaces\r\n- Modernised kitchen and north-facing covered deck\r\n- Peaceful setting with beautiful birdsong\r\n- Internal-access garage and excellent additional parking\r\n- Near-new concrete driveway with excellent drainage\r\n- Smart technology for lighting, heated towel rails and front door access\r\n- Just 600m from Long Bay Beach and Regional Park\r\n\r\nThe location is simply fantastic!\r\nEnjoy beach walks, weekend swims, coastal trails and the convenience of nearby Torbay and Long Bay Villages, with their cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities.\r\nFamilies will appreciate being within walking distance of Long Bay College, along with excellent zoning for Northcross Intermediate, Torbay School and Long Bay Primary.\r\n\r\nThe owners have already moved out, and this home is ready for its next chapter! With a quick settlement possible, you could be unpacked and enjoying Christmas in your new coastal home.\r\n\r\nCharacter, comfort and coastal living - all wrapped up in one fantastic location!**\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a family home with personality, room to make it your own or a lifestyle that puts the beach on your doorstep, 7 Long Bay Drive is a wonderful place to call home.\r\n\r\nCome along, explore the possibilities and see for yourself!\r\nView property files here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/AML9",
